HOME_MDX = '---\ntitle: "Open HEIC File Online Privately"\ndescription: "Open HEIC files online, preview photos in your browser, and save as JPG or PNG without uploading your image."\nslug: "open-heic-file"\nlastModified: "2026-05-05"\nindex: false\ncontentStatus: draft\n---\n\n## Open HEIC files instantly, privately\n\nPreview and convert HEIC images to JPG or PNG online. The selected image is processed in your browser session.\n'
FAQ_MDX = '---\ntitle: "Open HEIC File FAQ"\ndescription: "Frequently asked questions about opening HEIC files online."\nslug: "faq"\nlastModified: "2026-05-05"\nindex: false\ncontentStatus: draft\n---\n\n## FAQ\n\n### What is a HEIC file?\n\nHEIC is an image format commonly used by Apple devices for photos. It can keep good image quality with smaller file sizes, but some apps still do not support it.\n\n### Does this upload my image?\n\nNo. This tool is designed to decode the selected HEIC or HEIF file in your browser session.\n\n### Can I save the image as JPG or PNG?\n\nYes. After the preview is ready, use the download buttons to save a JPG or PNG copy.\n\n### Should I choose JPG or PNG?\n\nChoose JPG for broad compatibility. Choose PNG when you want a lossless copy.\n\n### Does this work without the Windows HEVC extension?\n\nIt depends on the browser and the specific HEIC variant. If browser decoding is not available, the page will show an error.\n\n### Can this repair a corrupted HEIC file?\n\nNo. This is a viewer and export helper, not a photo repair tool.\n'
